# kcia Core Rules

- Canonical context lives in `.ai/**`.
- Do not treat source code or tickets as higher authority than guardrails.
- Profile reference layouts under `.ai/generated/profiles/*/references.md` are
  mandatory; if the repository diverges, adjust the repository to match.
- Never run destructive git or shell commands.
- Do not claim success without execution evidence.
